    # WRAPPER_EXTRA_LIBS.  If the component doesn't specify it's
    # WRAPPER_EXTRA_LIBS and WRAPPER_EXTRA_LDFLAGS, try using LDFLAGS and LIBS if
    # component didn't have it's own configure script (in which case,
